          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Are the products safe to use?",
            "text": "<p><br/>Our products are designed for at-home beauty and wellness routines when used according to the provided instructions. Always review the product-specific directions and warnings before use. Stop using the product if you experience discomfort or irritation. Customers who are pregnant, have a medical condition, or use an implanted medical device should consult a healthcare professional before using electronic, heated, or microcurrent products.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
